{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And to teach.</b> This teaches that one who is drunk is forbidden to issue a ruling — one might think he is liable to death; therefore Scripture says ״אַתָּה וּבָנֶיךָ אִתְּךָ״ — and you shall not die: priests engaged in their service are subject to death, but sages engaged in ruling are not subject to death (there)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:38.744099682Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}